  "question": "设 $A = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ a & 1 & b \\\\ 4 & c & 6 \\end{pmatrix}$ ，且 $BA = 0$ ，其中 $B$ 为秩大于 1 的三阶方阵，求 $A^n$ 。",
  "answer": "$a = -2, b = -3, c = -2$ 。从而",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "伴随与逆矩阵",
    "矩阵秩",
    "矩阵运算"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 由 $BA = 0$ 易得到 $\\operatorname{rank}(A) = 1$ 。将 $A$ 做列行分解， $A^n$ 就容易计算了。"
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "由 $BA = 0$ ，有 $\\operatorname{rank}(A) + \\operatorname{rank}(B) \\leqslant 3$ ."
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "由于 $\\operatorname{rank}(B) > 1$ ，所以 $\\operatorname{rank}(A) \\leqslant 3 - \\operatorname{rank}(B) \\leqslant 1$ ."
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "显然 $\\operatorname{rank}(A) \\geqslant 1$ ，故 $\\operatorname{rank}(A) = 1$ ，于是 $A$ 的行向量成比例，即有"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {a}{2} = \\frac {1}{- 1} = \\frac {b}{3}, \\quad \\frac {2}{4} = \\frac {- 1}{c} = \\frac {3}{6}.\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "解得 $a = -2, b = -3, c = -2$ 。从而"
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "text": "$A = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 4 & -2 & 6 \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2 \\end{pmatrix} (2, -1, 3)$ ，故 $A^n = 9^{n-1} A = 9^{n-1} \\begin{pmatrix} 2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 4 & -2 & 6 \\end{pmatrix}$ ."
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$a = -2, b = -3, c = -2$ 。从而",
